// The story's chapters and the "era" the town is in during each one (5–7 years in all, D-017).
// A chapter ends when a quest with "endsChapter": true is done; time then skips to the next
// chapter's startDay and the town ages to that chapter's era.
//
// startDay counts from the outbreak (day 0 = Sept 1, see weather.json startDayOfYear).
// card = the line on the chapter title card. It's UI copy, not dialogue; placeholder.
//
// Era numbers are 0..1 except where noted:
//   overgrowth   tall grass, weeds in cracks, vines on walls (looks)
//   litter       trash and dead leaves on the ground (looks)
//   decay        broken windows and doors in other buildings
//   desaturate   how grey the town looks
//   lootLeft     share of loot still out there (1 = untouched)
//   zombies      zombie count vs. the start (can go above 1)
//   zombieSpeed  how fast they shamble vs. the start (they rot)
//   fuelLeft     share of gas left in parked cars (it goes stale too)
//   carsDead     share of parked cars that won't start any more
//   memereSupplies  her stash at the start of the chapter, as a share of the starting amount
//                   (the player kept her going off screen during the skip)
[
  { "number": 1, "id": "collapse", "title": "Collapse", "startDay": 0,
    "card": "September.",
    "era": { "overgrowth": 0.0, "litter": 0.12, "decay": 0.0, "desaturate": 0.0,
             "lootLeft": 1.0, "zombies": 1.0, "zombieSpeed": 1.0, "fuelLeft": 1.0, "carsDead": 0.0,
